            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Envoy response flags communicate discrete network or protocol failures: 'UH' means No Healthy Upstream host available in the cluster; 'UF' indicates Upstream Connection Failure (e.g. TCP reset or connection refused); 'UO' denotes Upstream Overflow (circuit breaker triggered on maximum pending requests); 'UT' signifies Upstream Request Timeout; and 'DC' indicates Downstream Connection termination before response completion."
          }
